' ============================================
' Manage Businesses Screen Layout
' ============================================
salt
{
  {T
    + <b>Manage Businesses (/accountant/businesses)</b>
    ++ <i>UC: Manage Business Accounts</i>
  }
  ====
  {
    {/ <b>Sidebar</b> | <b>Main Content</b>
    {
      [Navigation Menu]
    } |
    {
      <b><size:18>My Businesses</size></b>
      <i>Manage all business accounts you have access to</i>
      --
      {#
        <b>Active Businesses</b> | <b>Access Requests</b>
        <size:16>12</size> | <size:16><color:orange>3</color></size>
      }
      --
      [ Search businesses...      ] [Filter ▼] [Sort ▼]
      --
      <b>Business List:</b>
      {#
        | <b>Business Name</b> | <b>Owner</b> | <b>Status</b> | <b>Last Active</b> | <b>Actions</b>
        | ABC Corp | John Doe | <color:green>Active</color> | 2 hours ago | [Switch] [View]
        | XYZ Ltd | Jane Smith | <color:green>Active</color> | 1 day ago | [Switch] [View]
        | Tech Inc | Bob Wilson | <color:blue>Connected</color> | 3 days ago | [Switch] [View]
      }
      --
      <b>Pending Access Requests:</b>
      {#
        | <b>Business</b> | <b>Owner</b> | <b>Requested</b> | <b>Actions</b>
        | NewCo LLC | Sarah Johnson | 1 day ago | [Accept] [Decline]
        | StartUp Inc | Mike Brown | 2 days ago | [Accept] [Decline]
      }
    }
    }
  }
  ====
  <b>Actions:</b>
  * View all connected businesses
  * Search and filter businesses
  * Switch active business context
  * Accept/decline access requests
  * View business details
}
