' ============================================
' Invoice Upload Screen Layout
' ============================================
salt
{
  {T
    + <b>Invoice Upload (/invoice-upload)</b>
    ++ <i>UC: Upload Invoices</i>
  }
  ====
  {
    {/ <b>Sidebar</b> | <b>Main Content</b>
    {
      [Navigation Menu]
    } |
    {
      <b><size:18>Upload Invoices</size></b>
      <i>Upload and process expense invoices with AI extraction</i>
      --
      {
        <size:14><&cloud-upload></size>
        --
        <b>Drag & drop files here</b>
        <i>or click to browse</i>
        --
        Supported: PDF, JPG, PNG (Max 10MB)
      }
      --
      <b>Uploaded Files:</b>
      {#
        | <b>Filename</b> | <b>Size</b> | <b>Status</b> | <b>Confidence</b> | <b>Actions</b>
        | invoice_001.pdf | 245 KB | <color:green>✓ Completed</color> | 98% | [Verify] [View] [Delete]
        | receipt_002.jpg | 156 KB | <color:blue>⟳ Processing</color> | - | [Cancel]
        | invoice_003.pdf | 312 KB | <color:green>✓ Completed</color> | 92% | [Verify] [View] [Delete]
      }
      --
      [ Process All Files ]
    }
    }
  }
  ====
  <b>Actions:</b>
  * Drag & drop or select files
  * Upload multiple invoices
  * Start AI processing
  * View extraction progress
  * Verify extracted data (opens modal)
  * Remove files from queue
}
----
' ============================================
' Verification Modal Layout
' ============================================
salt
{
  {T
    + <b>Data Verification Modal</b>
    ++ <i>UC: Verify Extracted Data</i>
  }
  ====
  {
    <b><size:16>Verify Extracted Invoice Data</size></b>
    <i>Review and edit AI-extracted information</i>
    --
    {#
      | <b>Field</b> | <b>Extracted Value</b> | <b>Confidence</b> | <b>Edit</b>
      | Vendor Name | Acme Corporation | <color:green>98%</color> | "Acme Corporation     "
      | Invoice Number | INV-2024-1234 | <color:green>95%</color> | "INV-2024-1234       "
      | Invoice Date | 2024-01-15 | <color:green>92%</color> | "2024-01-15          "
      | Due Date | 2024-02-15 | <color:orange>88%</color> | "2024-02-15          "
      | Subtotal | 1200.00 | <color:green>97%</color> | "1200.00             "
      | VAT Rate | 20% | <color:green>90%</color> | "20                  "
      | VAT Amount | 240.00 | <color:green>96%</color> | "240.00              "
      | Total Amount | 1440.00 | <color:green>99%</color> | "1440.00             "
    }
    --
    <b>Line Items:</b>
    {#
      | <b>Description</b> | <b>Qty</b> | <b>Unit Price</b> | <b>Total</b> | <b>Confidence</b>
      | Consulting Services | 10 | 100.00 | 1000.00 | <color:green>94%</color>
      | Materials | 1 | 200.00 | 200.00 | <color:orange>89%</color>
    }
    --
    [ Cancel ] [ Save & Confirm ]
  }
  ====
  <b>Actions:</b>
  * Review extracted fields
  * Edit incorrect values
  * Check confidence scores
  * Save verified data
}
----
' ============================================
' Matching & Reconciliation Screen Layout
' ============================================
salt
{
  {T
    + <b>Matching & Reconciliation (/matching)</b>
    ++ <i>UC: Match Transactions</i>
  }
  ====
  {
    {/ <b>Sidebar</b> | <b>Main Content</b>
    {
      [Navigation Menu]
    } |
    {
      <b><size:18>Match & Reconcile</size></b>
      <i>Smart comparison and matching of invoices against bank transactions</i>
      --
      {#
        <b>Pending Invoices</b> | <b>Unmatched Transactions</b> | <b>Matched Today</b> | <b>AI Suggestions</b>
        <size:16><color:orange>4</color></size> | <size:16><color:orange>4</color></size> | <size:16><color:green>2</color></size> | <size:16><color:blue>2</color></size>
      }
      --
      <b>🤖 AI-Suggested Matches:</b>
      {
        {#
          | <b>Invoice</b> | <b>Transaction</b> | <b>Confidence</b> | <b>Reason</b> | <b>Actions</b>
          | INV-1234 Acme Corp | ACME CORPORATION | <color:green>98%</color> | Exact amount & vendor match | [✓ Confirm] [✗ Reject]
          | $1,250.00 | -$1,250.00 | | |
          | INV-1235 Office Depot | OFFICE DEPOT #4521 | <color:green>95%</color> | Amount match, 1 day proximity | [✓ Confirm] [✗ Reject]
          | $89.50 | -$89.50 | | |
        }
      }
      --
      {#
        <b>Unmatched Invoices</b> | <b>Unmatched Transactions</b>
        {
          | <b>Select</b> | <b>Invoice</b> | <b>Vendor</b> | <b>Amount</b>
          | ( ) | INV-1237 | Marketing Co | $2,100.00
          | (*) | INV-1238 | City Utilities | $156.80
        } |
        {
          | <b>Select</b> | <b>Transaction</b> | <b>Description</b> | <b>Amount</b>
          | ( ) | 2024-01-16 | CREATIVE MARKETING | -$2,100.00
          | (*) | 2024-01-06 | UTILITIES PAYMENT | -$156.80
        }
      }
      --
      [ <b>Create Manual Match</b> ]
      --
      <b>Recent Matches:</b>
      {#
        | <b>Invoice</b> | <b>Transaction</b> | <b>Matched At</b> | <b>Actions</b>
        | INV-1234 → | ACME CORPORATION | 2 mins ago | [Unmatch] [View]
      }
    }
    }
  }
  ====
  <b>Actions:</b>
  * View AI match suggestions
  * Confirm/reject AI matches
  * Select invoice and transaction
  * Create manual match
  * Unmatch incorrect pairs
  * View match details
}
