' ============================================
' VAT Report Screen Layout
' ============================================
salt
{
  {T
    + <b>VAT Report (/reports/vat)</b>
    ++ <i>UC: Generate VAT Report</i>
  }
  ====
  {
    {/ <b>Sidebar</b> | <b>Main Content</b>
    {
      [Navigation Menu]
    } |
    {
      <b><size:18>VAT Report</size></b>
      <i>Detailed VAT breakdown and compliance reporting</i>
      --
      <b>Report Parameters:</b>
      {
        Period: | [January 2024 ▼]
        Category: | [All Categories ▼]
        Status: | [All Status ▼]
      }
      [ Generate Report ]
      --
      {#
        <b>VAT Summary</b>
        | <b>Metric</b> | <b>Amount</b>
        | Total Sales | $45,678.00
        | VAT Collected | $9,135.60
        | Total Purchases | $23,456.00
        | VAT Paid | $4,691.20
        | <b>Net VAT Due</b> | <b><color:blue>$4,444.40</color></b>
      }
      --
      <b>VAT by Rate:</b>
      {#
        | <b>Rate</b> | <b>Taxable Amount</b> | <b>VAT Amount</b> | <b>Transactions</b>
        | 20% | $38,000.00 | $7,600.00 | 45
        | 5% | $5,000.00 | $250.00 | 12
        | 0% (Exempt) | $2,678.00 | $0.00 | 8
      }
      --
      <b>VAT by Category:</b>
      {#
        | <b>Category</b> | <b>Net</b> | <b>VAT</b> | <b>Gross</b>
        | Office Supplies | $1,200.00 | $240.00 | $1,440.00
        | Professional Services | $15,000.00 | $3,000.00 | $18,000.00
        | Utilities | $2,340.00 | $468.00 | $2,808.00
      }
      --
      [ <&download> Export PDF ] [ <&download> Export Excel ] [ <&download> Export CSV ]
    }
    }
  }
  ====
  <b>Actions:</b>
  * Select reporting period
  * Filter by category/status
  * Generate VAT report
  * View detailed breakdown
  * Export in multiple formats
}
