' ============================================
' AI Settings Screen Layout
' ============================================
salt
{
  {T
    + <b>AI Settings (/ai-settings)</b>
    ++ <i>UC: Configure AI</i>
  }
  ====
  {
    {/ <b>Sidebar</b> | <b>Main Content</b>
    {
      [Navigation Menu]
    } |
    {
      <b><size:18>AI Configuration & Settings</size></b>
      <i>Configure AI models and extraction parameters</i>
      --
      <b>AI Provider Selection:</b>
      {
        {
          (*) OpenAI (GPT-4)
          ( ) Google Cloud Vision
          ( ) AWS Textract
          ( ) Azure Form Recognizer
        }
      }
      --
      <b>Confidence Thresholds:</b>
      {
        Invoice Extraction: | [-----●----] 85%
        Vendor Matching: | [------●---] 90%
        Amount Detection: | [-------●--] 95%
        Date Recognition: | [-----●----] 80%
      }
      --
      <b>Auto-Matching Rules:</b>
      {
        [✓] Enable automatic matching
        [✓] Auto-approve high confidence (>95%)
        [ ] Auto-approve medium confidence (>80%)
        [✓] Send notifications for low confidence
      }
      --
      <b>AI Performance Metrics:</b>
      {#
        | <b>Metric</b> | <b>Value</b>
        | Accuracy Rate | <color:green>96.5%</color>
        | Processing Speed | 2.3 sec/invoice
        | Auto-Match Success | <color:green>92%</color>
        | Manual Review Rate | 8%
      }
      --
      [ Reset to Defaults ] [ Save Settings ]
    }
    }
  }
  ====
  <b>Actions:</b>
  * Select AI provider
  * Adjust confidence thresholds
  * Configure auto-matching rules
  * View AI performance metrics
  * Save configuration changes
}
@enduml
